sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Guest browser
  participant P as Next.js page
  participant A as API Route Handler
  participant S as Store / Postgres
  participant E as Resend
  participant N as notifyManager
  participant T as Termii
  participant M as Manager phone

  Note over G,M: Room reservation flow
  G->>P: Submit booking form
  P->>A: POST /api/reservations
  A->>A: Zod validate
  A->>S: persist reservation
  A->>E: sendReservationEmail (optional)
  A->>N: reservation.created
  alt NOTIFY_CHANNEL=sms + keys set
    N->>T: send SMS
    T->>M: alert
  else demo
    N->>N: console log
  end
  A-->>G: { ok, id, emailSent }

  Note over G,M: Payment flow
  G->>A: POST /api/paystack/initialize
  A->>G: authorizationUrl
  G->>G: Paystack hosted checkout
  G->>A: GET /api/paystack/verify
  A->>S: addPayment
  A->>N: payment.verified
  N->>M: SMS or console
